    what="""WHAT IT IS. The King draws a slow deep breath and spits to the right, calmly and regally, then settles back to its smile. It rises a little and leans back with its eyes closing, its cheeks swell, its mouth parts into a small round opening, and it spits: the body leans forward, the face is thrust forward and the mouth opens wide and round (the release frame), then it recoils, closes its mouth and settles. Nothing leaves the mouth, nothing glows inside it (the game draws the ooze, the light and the impact). It stays over the same spot on the floor; only the dome above the base moves.""",
