    cut="`Animations/SlimeKing/source/cut_king.py` (the Elite's machinery: one shared scale, base 350 px, floor y 470, base centre x 259) into `Animations/SlimeKing/radiant_ooze/king_radiant_ooze_8frame_strip.png` (slot `attack`), about 12 fps with the Ember Spit's holds [1, 1, 1.4, 1.4, 1.1, 1, 1, 1], the mouth point of every frame marked by eye (a `.mouth.json`, as the slimes have).",
    specific='If anything leaves the mouth or glows: "Redo it. NOTHING comes out of the mouth and NOTHING glows: the mouth is only a dark opening; the game draws the ooze and the light." If the mouth shows teeth or a pink tongue: "Redo it. The King has NO teeth and NO tongue: the open mouth is a plain dark warm-brown opening." If the body squashes or stretches: "Redo it. The King is a heavy soft lump: the dome keeps its shape; it only rises a few percent and LEANS, pivoting on its base." If there is no forward lean at the release: "Redo it. In panels 5 and 6 the whole body leans clearly forward (to the right, toward the enemy) with the face thrust forward and the mouth wide open." ',
